{
  "an10.24:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 10.24 ",
  "an10.24:0.2": "3. The Great Chapter ",
  "an10.24:0.3": "By Mahācunda ",
  "an10.24:1.1": "At one time Venerable Mahācunda was staying in the land of the Cetīs at Sahajāti. ",
  "an10.24:1.2": "There he addressed the mendicants: ",
  "an10.24:1.3": "“Reverends, mendicants!” ",
  "an10.24:1.4": "“Reverend,” they replied. ",
  "an10.24:1.5": "Venerable Mahācunda said this: ",
  "an10.24:2.1": "“Reverends, a mendicant who makes a declaration of knowledge says: ",
  "an10.24:2.2": "‘I know this teaching, I see this teaching.’ ",
  "an10.24:2.3": "Suppose that greed masters that mendicant and keeps going. ",
  "an10.24:2.4": "Or that hate … ",
  "an10.24:2.5": "delusion … ",
  "an10.24:2.6": "anger … ",
  "an10.24:2.7": "acrimony … ",
  "an10.24:2.8": "disdain … ",
  "an10.24:2.9": "contempt … ",
  "an10.24:2.10": "stinginess … ",
  "an10.24:2.11": "nasty jealousy … ",
  "an10.24:2.12": "or corrupt wishes master that mendicant and keep going. You should know of them: ",
  "an10.24:2.13": "‘This venerable does not have the understanding that would eliminate greed, so greed masters them and keeps going. ",
  "an10.24:2.14": "They don’t have the understanding that would eliminate hate … ",
  "an10.24:2.15": "delusion … ",
  "an10.24:2.16": "anger … ",
  "an10.24:2.17": "acrimony … ",
  "an10.24:2.18": "disdain … ",
  "an10.24:2.19": "contempt … ",
  "an10.24:2.20": "stinginess … ",
  "an10.24:2.21": "nasty jealousy 